# THE OBSIDIAN VAULT LIVES IN THIS DIRECTORY AND IS NOT PART OF THE REPOSITORY.
#
# On 2026-07-28 apps/, fixtures/ and 40 scripts were physically moved out of the
# tracked layout into "AWE Founder Brain/ENGINEERING/" and the move was never
# recorded, so git reported 167 deletions for five weeks. A single `git add -A`
# would have committed the vault and removed the application in the same commit.
# The files are restored; these entries stop the vault from ever being staged.
.obsidian/
.claudian/
AWE/
AWE Founder Brain/
AWE Operational Memory/
Operational Decision Layer/
Organizational Reality/
*.zip
*.docx
